      {
        "id": "p11-q4-k",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "k",
        "prompt": "$x=\\frac{7}{2x+3}+1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac{5}{2}$ or $x=2$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne-\\frac32$, isolate the fraction and multiply by $2x+3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x-1&=\\frac{7}{2x+3}\\\\(x-1)(2x+3)&=7\\\\2x^2+x-3&=7\\\\2x^2+x-10&=0\\\\2x^2+5x-4x-10&=0\\\\x(2x+5)-2(2x+5)&=0\\\\(2x+5)(x-2)&=0\\\\2x+5&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-2=0\\\\x&=-\\frac52\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=2\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values satisfy the original equation.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 88
      },
      {
        "id": "p11-q4-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$x=\\frac{13}{3x-1}-3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac43$ or $x=-4$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne\\frac13$, isolate the fraction and multiply by $3x-1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x+3&=\\frac{13}{3x-1}\\\\(x+3)(3x-1)&=13\\\\3x^2+8x-3&=13\\\\3x^2+8x-16&=0\\\\3x^2+12x-4x-16&=0\\\\3x(x+4)-4(x+4)&=0\\\\(3x-4)(x+4)&=0\\\\3x-4&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x+4=0\\\\x&=\\frac43\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-4\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values satisfy the original equation.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 88
